eration": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:47:49.640407+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"17086502-7012-4cbe-b56f-0a60382b8cf0\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/></p><p>Зна­че­ние про­из­вод­ной в точке ка­са­ния равно уг­ло­во­му ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ту ка­са­тель­ной. По­сколь­ку ка­са­тель­ная па­рал­лель­на пря­мой <i>y</i>  =  −2<i>x</i> − 10 или сов­па­да­ет с ней, их уг­ло­вые ко­эф­фи­ци­ен­ты равны −2. Най­дем ко­ли­че­ство точек, в ко­то­рых <span data-inline-latex=\"f'(x)=-2\"></span>, это со­от­вет­ству­ет ко­ли­че­ству точек пе­ре­се­че­ния гра­фи­ка про­из­вод­ной с пря­мой <i>y</i>  =  −2. Таких точек 5.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": ["image_2"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:47:49.640407+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:47:49.640407+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:47:49.640407+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/b7aa361a-2710-40ff-bd32-92abee5f5d04", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "b7aa361a-2710-40ff-bd32-92abee5f5d04", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/17086502-7012-4cbe-b56f-0a60382b8cf0", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "17086502-7012-4cbe-b56f-0a60382b8cf0", "asset_key": "image_2", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_2"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img